    {
      "lineId": "70c7a8e5cb0779c8",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "鐘樓響了三下，市場收起遮陽棚；孩子抱著紙船跑回來，我們把晚餐移到騎樓。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "a04cd6fc2d34bf84",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "70e2f1d6d68cc76f",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "我一直珍藏著那枚由你在搬家前親手縫進舊外套內袋的小小木扣子",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "bf873f016c1020af",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "30ce86ec0da9f441",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "OH OH 再一次再一次",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "6d6443c19e25f37a",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "3b3f4e1c91357569",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "[甲] 先把燈留給晚歸的人 [乙] 我會守著這扇門直到你回來",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "c502964d16b47785",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "fdf6063c95143f23",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "等收音機播完這首老歌，we can start again，不用急著回答我。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "d14fc13214f5906c",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "366221d4853bb913",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "我把空椅留在身旁（和聲：等你啊等你），等門鈴喚醒安靜的走廊。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "0c9802daf06c226d",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "bd9aece5d697e6ab",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "當你終於找到那把備用鑰匙的時候，記得替我打開門口的小燈。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "e8b19a852534e0a4",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "4b3fc24330b65edb",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "我捨不得把還沒寫完的便條丟掉，只好再替它找一個抽屜。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "d1b5907f4491ddb3",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "8ab08d07f1bb264f",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "你把「編曲：未完成的夏天」唱了兩遍，我才發現那也是我們的暗號。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "bdd7fde5bd2d22de",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "5571c3a1d021d456",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "作曲：林岸",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "04a9b78433b953d1",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "d8dfe0ff8be2b1ee",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "【編曲 許岑】",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "9f604b0159fcde88",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "a7889df84eae539d",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "[小青] 把窗打開 [阿朗] 我聽見你了",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "7c921b2c04c4936b",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "c52799883092cecf",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "和聲：啊啊（一起唱，別停下）",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "f189bc7e76873a08",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "20d86d9635f54678",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "她唱著「作詞：回家的人」，尾音還繞在樓梯間。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "b2a5d77a77b3c958",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "86717580636795fc",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "作詞：江雨 / 今夜請把我的名字唱進燈火裡",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "07c62ef722c91b49",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "1b20c91570624588",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "編曲：沉默",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "bdce80a2ae992ec0",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "64f5c8c8f8f64aab",
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "text": "編曲：沉默",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "f2ec6d00be05912e",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "bc28d8dc461cad9a",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "院子里的葡萄已经熟了 外婆把竹椅搬到树下 我端着茶等她讲完故事",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "02ccc84a4815f518",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "fa80051795bdc42f",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "院子里的葡萄已经熟了  \t　外婆把竹椅搬到树下  \t　我端着茶等她讲完故事",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "dd13b56d1c24c4cf",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "d7be5b3f6db6d109",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "院子里的葡萄已经熟了外婆把竹椅搬到树下我端着茶等她讲完故事",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "c9c40dabfb6df1f2",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "897bd60657ce391e",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "渡口升起第一面旗，修船的人卷起衣袖；有人喊了一声开饭，我们沿着小路走向炊烟。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "d75fe628b3f61536",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "7681f13a43d66f9f",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "你送给我的那本夹着干花和旧电影票的蓝色笔记本一直放在最上层的书架上",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "cb55e44786fa0a7a",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "7630ab9bafa6b491",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "HEY HEY 还要唱还要唱",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "3fffcb542ca9b3b5",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "7422b81c6886cee8",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "[姐姐] 你先坐下来歇一会儿 [弟弟] 等我把桌上的拼图拼完",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "c1a0a44e83c95b7c",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "fabdd31e48b97811",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "把风筝交给我，take your time，我们还赶得上日落。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "47f1c123034ad869",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "314e33fafed02194",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "我会沿着你画的箭头前行（合唱：向前向前），直到山谷里传来回答。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "65eb52379b45458e",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "cef56c64406b7a23",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "在你把所有没说出口的愿望写进信封之后，我们再一起去敲那扇门。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "b7e930713f3cedcf",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "ff1fcce2c4813997",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "我始终舍不得让刚学会飞翔的纸鹤停在原地，于是又轻轻推开窗。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "3a6193ddf7ce0be9",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "f961f74e1d7ab29b",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "你笑着念出“作曲：会发光的石头”，小河也跟着哼了起来。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "a11fd186923d0282",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "13f8ef4006779c75",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "作词：赵禾",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "69ddb0106c24032e",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "dc1244106662a31e",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "【作曲 周苇】",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "af463c2494081fd2",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "0ef63c7f29baa947",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "[阿宁] 让我先说 [小满] 我一直在听",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "995cac60fe70b556",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "b20a952e5ab30ecb",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "合唱：啦啦啦（别停，跟着我）",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "8143d5b687de69c1",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "5c5107f0979145a8",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "我把“编曲：等花开”当成歌词唱给你听。",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "aa4c00e31b6e2a2e",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "d05fff145e322769",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "作曲：宋川 / 请把这盏灯带到山的那一边",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "89185b664cfff298",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "2dddf3ff78e3d2f9",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "作词：告别",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "3b3b4750639678da",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "bb7263d95477f0bb",
      "language": "zh-Hans",
      "text": "作词：告别",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "33a487fc288ff926",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "5eb1de0b5d2d00d9",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The bakery opens before sunrise you save the broken chair beside the door I bring a cup for anyone who stays",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "d229fef9696f9c17",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "97a13f81dde6be98",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The bakery opens before sunrise   \t you save the broken chair beside the door   \t I bring a cup for anyone who stays",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "e923be0c8d271062",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "520bb24f43588aef",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The bakery opens before sunrise you save the broken chair beside the door I bring a cup for anyone who stays",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "fc50aff65cc79950",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "3683def16f0e6b6f",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The ferry sounds its horn; a gull drops from the rail; you wave your scarf above the crowd; I lift the suitcase with the missing wheel.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "033c60d37b69214f",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "564cbddf53f92b95",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I still wear the slightly oversized yellow sweater that your little brother knitted for my first winter away from home",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "59412f5b4270760c",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "ef1d4f963619df1f",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "OH OH STAY STAY é🌙",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "843b6fbec581bdae",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "a06c5e87cc2d6193",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "[June] Keep a little room for me at the table [Robin] I have kept your place through every season",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "3425586a5aae703f",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "413f107e3d24e069",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Fold the map along the river, もう迷わないよ, we can ask the moon for directions.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "c63520e2d304b1a2",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "772298e08c64942b",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I will carry the melody (choir: carry it softly), while you find the words you meant to say.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "f0dae4cd30db3881",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "07c2c25ca875fd78",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "When the person who borrowed your umbrella returns, leave a clean towel by the kitchen door.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "30d5c73d13108977",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "116579be3b4beb44",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I don't want to give up the promise we made, even if the letters on the wall begin to fade.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "20bf8f4f21d4d4f3",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "5a4d60b373c670f3",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "She sings \"Written by the city that forgot us\", and the empty platform answers in a whisper.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "15ed8749ff8c59b8",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "8c427bef188e0bb9",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Music by Mira Vale",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "d2b8ff50dc04fe7b",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "23578d77bd6c5b5e",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "【Arranged by Rowan Lake】",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "521c7da571f58c16",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "4cbcb740b06cd243",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "[Nora] Pass me the tune [Eli] I will take the next verse",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "dc2cd15f55b95d29",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "6484d0b66af5953a",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Backing vocals: oh oh (all together now)",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "be8f4bb8cb69265a",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "f622cc75e300b36a",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "You sang “Music by the rain” until the kettle answered.",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "9b5214e1a5819daa",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "0c0c134e74b18933",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Lyrics by Wren Hall / Keep your hands above the water",
      "source": {
        "documentId": "c46cd922e8326b64",
        "startMs": 12000,
        "endMs": 20000
      }
    },
    {
      "lineId": "29ba590acfefd7ff",
